                                <h3>TABLE OF CONTENT</h3>
                                <li><a href="#1">Build up Clear Goals</a></li>
                                <li><a href="#2">Understand Your focused clients</a></li>    
                                <li><a href="#3">Find out your competitors</a></li>  
                                <li><a href="#4">Use Various Channels</a></li>   
                                <li><a href="#5">Create Rich Content</a></li>
                                <li><a href="#6">Utilize Information and Analysis</a></li>  
                                <li><a href="#7">Building validity and believe</a></li>   
